# Ingestion Data, Storage, Assets & Cache (转录产物、本地缓存与下载资源)
# 注意：必须精确锚定运行时数据路径，严禁使用裸 storage/ 或 **/storage/，否则源码目录 apps/client/src/lib/storage 会被误吞！
.data/
**/.data/
/storage/
/apps/client/storage/
/apps/worker/storage/
public/assets/
**/public/assets/
config.json
**/config.json
chrome/
**/chrome/
.zcode/
**/.zcode/

